    ],
    bottomLine: "The 15 kg bar to buy on Amazon for a thinner grip, a lighter start or a second bar for the household.",
    description: "The 15 kg Regional is the women's-standard version of the Synergee Regional bar above. Living.Fit lists it at 79.13 inches long, with a 25 mm shaft, 13-inch loadable sleeves, a 190,000 PSI tensile strength, a 1,500 lb capacity, ten needle bearings, a 1.2 mm diamond knurl with dual marks and no center knurl; the Amazon listing gives the same 15 kg and 1,500 lb rating, and review listings give the same 25 mm shaft, length and sleeve length. The Amazon listing we link is the black phosphate version, which showed $149.95 on 9 November 2026, the same price Living.Fit listed. The limit is the sleeves: 13 inches is plenty for most training but holds fewer thick bumper plates than a 20 kg bar. Before ordering, check that the bar's shaft will span your rack's J-cups, as explained in the rack-fit section above. If you want a coloured coating instead, the Synergee Games bar above is also sold as a 15 kg bar.",
  },
  {
    id: "titan-performance-series-olympic-barbell",
